## Step 7 — One-time post-build fix (libuuid)

Run from any directory (`libuuid.so.1.3.0` must be in `lib64/` when you create the link):

  cd $PREFIX_DIR/target/xalt2/xalt/xalt/lib64
  ln -sf libuuid.so.1.3.0 libuuid.so

