## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|--------|-----|
| `LD_PRELOAD` is `/sw/workload/...` | System xalt loaded | `source load_local_xalt.sh` |
| No JSON files | Hostname SKIP in build | Step 2; rebuild; grep `.lex` |
| JSON under `target/delta/json` | Stock modulefile | Use customized `build_xalt.sh` + `3.0.2.lua.in` |
| Permission denied on `/sw/workload/.../sitecustomize.py` | Production PYTHONPATH | `load_local_xalt.sh` |
| `libuuid.so` missing | No symlink | Step 7 |
| `ModuleNotFoundError` | No venv | `source venv/bin/activate` |
| Too many `pkg.*` | Steps 3–4 not applied or not rebuilt | Re-check edits; rebuild with `XALT_LOCAL_ONLY=yes` |

Debug trace:

  export XALT_TRACING=yes
  python3 /tmp/test3.py 2> /tmp/xalt_trace.txt
  grep -i hostname /tmp/xalt_trace.txt

